OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy to start as
OL,6,Fpatchy rain clears in the morning.
OL,7,FLater on, some breaks in the cloud
OL,8,Fmainly in northern areas to give sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Light winds and temperatures
OL,10,Fnear normal.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FLargely dry with cloudier
OL,13,Fskies in the south this evening.
OL,14,FClearer spells developing more widely
OL,15,Fovernight with temperatures falling
OL,16,Faway. Colder with a touch of frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
