OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA chilly and bright start.
OL,6,FPlenty of autumnal sunshine throughout
OL,7,Fthe day. Colder, especially in the
OL,8,Fnortherly breeze with a widespread
OL,9,Ffrost overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FAnother
OL,12,Fcrisp autumnal day on Friday after a
OL,13,Ffrosty start. Hazier sunshine over the
OL,14,Fweekend. Breezy with temperatures
OL,15,Fgradually recovering.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
